hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2760","Narrated to us by Al-Abbar ibn al-Ala', who said: Narrated to us Sufyan, on the authority of Amr, who is Ibn Dinar, who said: We asked Ibn Umar (RA), and he said: \Indeed"," the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) arrived and performed Tawaf around the House seven times"," prayed two rak'ahs behind the Maqam (Station of Ibrahim)"," and performed Sa'i between Safa and Marwah seven times. 'Indeed"," in the Messenger of Allah you have"""
